dance moves better.

00:05:38.868 --> 00:05:40.534
Can you help us figure out,
once and for all,

00:05:40.534 --> 00:05:42.367
who's the better dancer?"

00:05:42.367 --> 00:05:43.567
I think we can do that.

00:05:43.567 --> 00:05:45.334
Ladies and gentlemen,
it's time for a dance-off

00:05:45.334 --> 00:05:48.067
between Wednesday Addams
and M3GAN the robot.

00:05:48.067 --> 00:05:50.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:50.067 --> 00:05:53.067
[ The Cramps'
"Goo Goo Muck" plays ]

00:05:53.067 --> 00:05:55.200
-♪ Yeah, I cruise
through the city ♪

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.100
♪ And I roam the streets ♪

00:05:57.100 --> 00:06:00.834
♪♪

00:06:00.834 --> 00:06:07.334
[ Taylor Swift's "It's Nice
to Have a Friend" plays ]

00:06:07.334 --> 00:06:09.167
♪ You better duck ♪

00:06:09.167 --> 00:06:10.834
♪ When I show up ♪

00:06:10.834 --> 00:06:14.868
♪ The goo goo muck ♪

00:06:14.868 --> 00:06:19.868
[ "It's Nice to Have
a Friend" plays ]

00:06:19.868 --> 00:06:22.367
-♪ It's nice to have a friend ♪

00:06:22.367 --> 00:06:24.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:24.534 --> 00:06:27.033
-♪ Oh-la, oh-la, ayy ♪

00:06:27.033 --> 00:06:29.434
♪ Oh-la, oh-la, ayy ♪

00:06:29.434 --> 00:06:31.767
♪ Rolling, rolling, roll
with Kid 'N Play now ♪

00:06:31.834 --> 00:06:34.367
♪ Rolling, rolling, roll
with Kid 'N Play now ♪

00:06:34.367 --> 00:06:36.367
♪ Rolling, rolling, roll ♪

00:06:36.367 --> 00:06:37.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:37.868 --> 00:06:40.400
-Come on!
-Come on, now!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.701
